-LocalTaxDesc=Some countries may apply two or three taxes on each invoice line. If this is the case, choose the type for the second and third tax and its rate. Possible type are:<br>1: local tax apply on products and services without vat (localtax is calculated on amount without tax)<br>2: local tax apply on products and services including vat (localtax is calculated on amount + main tax)<br>3: local tax apply on products without vat (localtax is calculated on amount without tax)<br>4: local tax apply on products including vat (localtax is calculated on amount + main vat)<br>5: local tax apply on services without vat (localtax is calculated on amount without tax)<br>6: local tax apply on services including vat (localtax is calculated on amount + tax)
+ComputedFormulaDesc=您可以在这里输入一个公式，使用对象的其他属性或任何PHP编码来获得一个动态的计算值。您可以使用任何与PHP兼容的公式，包括"?"条件运算符，以及以下全局对象。<strong>$db, $conf, $langs, $mysoc, $user, $object</strong>。<br><strong>警告</strong>。只有$object的某些属性可能是可用的。如果您需要一个未加载的属性，只需像第二个例子那样，自己读取对象到您的公式中。<br>使用一个计算字段意味着您不能自己从接口中输入任何值。另外，如果有语法错误，公式可能什么都不返回。<br><br>公式的例子：<br>$object->id < 10 ? round($object->id / 2, 2): ($object->id + 2 * $user->id) * (int) substr($mysoc->zip, 1, 2)<br><br>示例重新加载对象<br>(($reloadedobj = new Societe($db)) && ($reloadedobj->fetchNoCompute($obj->id ? $obj->id: ($obj->rowid ? $obj->rowid: $object->id)) > 0)) ? $reloadedobj->array_options['options_extrafieldkey'] * $reloadedobj->capital / 5: '-1'<br>其他公式的例子，强制加载对象及其父对象。 <br>(($reloadedobj = new Task($db)) && ($reloadedobj->fetchNoCompute($object->id) > 0) && ($secondloadedobj = new Project($db)) && ($secondloadedobj->fetchNoCompute($reloadedobj->fk_project) > 0) ) ？$secondloadedobj->ref: '没有找到父项目' ?
+Computedpersistent=存储计算字段
+ComputedpersistentDesc=计算过的额外字段将被存储在数据库中，然而，只有当这个字段的对象被改变时，其数值才会被重新计算。如果计算过的字段依赖于其他对象或全局数据，这个值可能是错误的！!
